        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset CV, Traditional Cove Colonial Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis attractive colonial style knob's traditional design makes a simple yet elegant statement in any home. Kwikset's Cove Knobset is features an easy installation and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". The Cove Door Knob And Rose Set is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH344-specifications.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"276\" height=\"310\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Kwikset CV Installed\">\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Cove Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Cove Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Cove Door Knob And Rose Set, Kwikset CV",
                "description": "Kwikset CV Cove Knob Set - This attractive colonial style knob's traditional design makes a simple yet elegant statement in any home. Kwikset's Cove Knobset is features an easy installation and will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is backed by a lifetime mechanical and  finish warranty. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Cove Door Knob And Rose Set is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.",
                "keywords": "KWI-Cove-Knob, KWI-CV kwikset Cove Door Knobs,  kwikset security series, kwi-488cv half dummy knobs, kwi-200cv passage knobs, kwi-300cv privacy knobs, kwi-405cv keyed entry knobs, residential door knob sets, traditional Design half-round knobs, Cove Round Knobs, KWI-P, classic Cove colonial knobs, Industrial chic hardware,"
